WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.864
In tutorial 6.7, you'll read a
written page before you publish it,

00:00:10.914 --> 00:00:13.036
and take everything you
need to put it live.

00:00:14.057 --> 00:00:18.557
First, open the report of a written
page. The top shows its status,

00:00:18.607 --> 00:00:22.722
and the grade of the page you receive,
next to the grade of the first draft.

00:00:23.726 --> 00:00:28.051
Further down, Questions only you can
answer make the page more specific;

00:00:28.101 --> 00:00:33.751
you answer them in tutorial 6.8. Change
the page yourself opens the editor,

00:00:33.801 --> 00:00:37.109
and Approve and publish sends
the page on when you're happy.

00:00:38.124 --> 00:00:42.299
Scroll down to The page. Preview shows
it the way your readers will see it,

00:00:42.349 --> 00:00:47.688
with a spot for each image. Click Copy
HTML to paste it into your website.

00:00:48.688 --> 00:00:54.288
Switch to HTML, or to Markdown, plain
text with simple marks for headings.

00:00:54.338 --> 00:00:58.163
Meta holds the page details,
like its title and description,

00:00:58.213 --> 00:01:00.915
and Copy meta.json copies them.

00:01:01.944 --> 00:01:05.644
Meta starts with the author
and reviewer named on the page.

00:01:05.694 --> 00:01:08.969
The publishing checklist lists
what to do as you publish it,

00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:11.056
and the outline shows its headings.

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:15.525
Then check the image plan,
the links to your own pages,

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:18.625
and how it looks when
shared on social media.

00:01:18.675 --> 00:01:22.350
Sources lists what the page cites,
and Secondary keywords used,

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.103
the other searches it covers.

00:01:25.097 --> 00:01:30.297
Need the files? Downloads, at the
top, gives you the page as PDF, Word,

00:01:30.347 --> 00:01:33.040
HTML and Markdown, with its images.

00:01:34.025 --> 00:01:38.130
If a page misses the mark, click Not
what I wanted, say what was wrong,

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:39.296
and click Mark it.

00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:47.475
Alaventra takes your reason into account.
If pages it chose on its own keep missing,

00:01:47.525 --> 00:01:49.456
it writes only for your keywords.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:55.375
So, read the status and grade, see your
options, read the preview, switch tabs,

00:01:55.425 --> 00:02:00.160
go through the checklist, check images,
links and sources, download the files,

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:01.532
and say what was wrong.

00:02:02.517 --> 00:02:07.392
Your page is ready to go live. Next,
answer the questions on a written page,

00:02:07.442 --> 00:02:09.329
in tutorial 6.8.
